Hi Mari,

as Lucía said, create separate tag groups for all relevant tags. camtrapR won't read tags properly if there are multiple levels of hierarchy.

See vignette 2 for examples.

https://jniedballa.github.io/camtrapR/articles/camtrapr2.html#metadata-tagging

Here I link the github version because I just discovered a critical typo in the vignette in the package which shows the intended structure wrongly. In the link above it is fixed. Have a look at the little screenshot in particular, that's what you want.

Jürgen

